//! Units of measure (`specs/units.md`): the packs a program names its units from, each a module
//! of `dimension` and `unit` items: `si`, `information`, `angle` and `currency`. A program
//! imports the units it uses, `use moddil::units::si::{m, cm, s};`. Units are the type checker's:
//! nothing here exists at run time.
